{
  "@context": "https://www.w3.org/2022/wot/td/v1.1",
  "@type": "tm:ThingModel",
  "title": "Ore batch",
  "titles": {
    "en": "Ore batch",
    "ru": "Партия руды"
  },
  "description": "One block on its way from the face to the SAG mill. Created and deleted by the simulator; passport: block, est_cu, est_axb, est_ascu (block model estimates). The state follows the last tonne of the batch; pit_t is still in the pit, tonnes_left is not yet fed (weigher accounting). States: PLANNED, DIG, BELT, IN_STOCK, DONE.",
  "version": {
    "model": "1.0.0"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "rel": "tm:submodel",
      "href": "http://akt-models/tm/state-batch-1.0.0.tm.jsonld",
      "type": "application/tm+json",
